### Arcade Physics Body Set Max Velocity

Source: https://github.com/phaserjs/phaser/blob/v3.90.0/changelog/3.50/CHANGELOG-v3.50.md

New methods to set the maximum horizontal and vertical velocity for an Arcade Physics Body.

```javascript
/**
 * Set the maximum horizontal velocity of this Body.
 * @param {number} value - The maximum horizontal velocity.
 * @returns {Phaser.Physics.Arcade.Body} This Body instance.
 */
body.setMaxVelocityX(value);

/**
 * Set the maximum vertical velocity of this Body.
 * @param {number} value - The maximum vertical velocity.
 * @returns {Phaser.Physics.Arcade.Body} This Body instance.
 */
body.setMaxVelocityY(value);
```

--------------------------------

### Arcade Physics maxSpeed Property

Source: https://github.com/phaserjs/phaser/blob/v3.90.0/changelog/3.16/CHANGELOG-v3.16.md

The Arcade Physics Body now has a `maxSpeed` property to limit the velocity vector's length. This can be set using the `setMaxSpeed` method and is applied in the `World.computeVelocity` method.

```javascript
/**
 * Sets the maximum speed of the Arcade Physics Body.
 * @param {number} value The maximum speed.
 */
body.setMaxSpeed(value);
```

