### Fix: Arcade Physics Body.speed Update

Source: https://github.com/phaserjs/phaser/blob/v3.90.0/changelog/3.12/CHANGELOG-v3.12.md

Ensures the Arcade Physics `Body.speed` property is correctly set whenever velocity is changed via `setVelocity`, `setVelocityX`, or `setVelocityY`. This prevents the body velocity from resetting to zero when `useDamping` is enabled. Fix #3888

```javascript
/**
 * Fix: The Arcade Physics `Body.speed` property is now set whenever you set the velocity via `setVelocity` or `setVelocityX` or `setVelocityY` which stops the body velocity being reset to zero if `useDamping` is enabled. Fix #3888
 */
// Conceptual fix:
// Body.prototype.setVelocity = function(x, y) {
//   this.velocity.x = x;
//   this.velocity.y = y;
//   this.speed = Phaser.Math.Distance.Between(0, 0, x, y);
// }
```

